# Project workflow

Before implementing anything, read `AGENTS.md` and the relevant files in `docs/`.

Identify the feature/module and open only the source files you need. Search for existing components, utilities, APIs, and patterns before creating new ones.

Follow `docs/architecture.md` and `docs/decisions.md`.

After a significant feature, architecture change, or important technical decision, update the matching doc. Do not document trivial changes. Never modify application code only to update documentation unless the user asks.
